    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7304" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cĕlendĕris</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-dris</span></b> ), is,
		f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κελένδερις</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a fortified harbor
			in</i> Cilicia, now <i>Kelenderi</i>, <i>the Turkish Gulnar</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 1, 13,
				4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 2, 80</span></i>.—Hence,
				adj.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cĕlendĕrī-tis</span></b> ,
				ĭdis, <i>of
			Celenderis</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">regio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					5, 27, 22, § 92</span></i>
			.</div>
